1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,274
In 1994, half of this
country deleted New

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,040
Year's Eve.

3
00:00:04,319 --> 00:00:06,560
Kiribati was split by
the date line, so

4
00:00:06,606 --> 00:00:08,499
its east was almost
a day behind.

5
00:00:08,742 --> 00:00:10,286
The two halves could
do business only

6
00:00:10,379 --> 00:00:11,355
four days a week.

7
00:00:11,529 --> 00:00:13,351
So it moved the line
around the whole

8
00:00:13,398 --> 00:00:14,048
country.

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,299
Friday, December
thirtieth, was followed

10
00:00:17,334 --> 00:00:19,540
