first.

11
00:00:20,143 --> 00:00:21,769
Now its islands greet
every new year

12
00:00:21,827 --> 00:00:23,197
before any other
country.

13
00:00:23,708 --> 00:00:24,509
And the east?

14
00:00:24,718 --> 00:00:27,074
No New Year's Eve
party in 1994.

15
00:00:27,283 --> 00:00:27,864
Sorry.

16
00:00:28,305 --> 00:00:29,814
Business first.

